## 10. What NOT to Do

- ❌ Never use `#10B981`, `#0EA5E9`, `#EC4899` — those are V1 colors
- ❌ Never use `--fin-up` / `--fin-down` for UI state colors (form errors, badges) — use `--error` / `--success`
- ❌ Never use `--error` for financial P&L loss indicators — use `--fin-down`
- ❌ Never use flat white or grey hex for card backgrounds — use a `--surface-*` token (plus §7.1 flow tokens on transactional pages)
- ❌ On flow pages, do **not** fill large selection panels with `--gradient-primary` — reserve it for **titles, stepper active state, and in-progress processing**; use `--surface-action-green` / `--surface-action-green-strong` with `--fin-up` borders for selected rows/cards
- ❌ Never use `--primary-green` / `--accent-pink` for hover states on the dark nav — yellow only
- ❌ Never import Space Grotesk — TestFoundersGrotesk only
- ❌ Never save new-brand files outside `NewUnera/`
